LevelMinded @PROJECT_VERSION@
============================

Optimized 3D map design tool.

Run LevelMinded.exe. No installation needed; nothing else is required in this folder.

Requirements
------------
- Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit
- A GPU with Direct3D 11 support
- @LM_CPU_REQUIREMENT@

Viewport controls
-----------------
Alt + left drag        Orbit
Middle drag            Pan
Alt + right drag       Zoom (also: mouse wheel)
Right drag + W/A/S/D   Fly (Q/E down/up, Shift faster, wheel sets fly speed)
F / Home               Focus origin / reset view
Numpad 1 / 3 / 7       Front / right / top view (Ctrl: opposite side)
F1                     Show / hide the stats overlay

Panels
------
Hierarchy (left)  Click a group to select everything inside it; the eye icon hides a group and its
                  contents; drag rows to reorder or move them into groups; double-click or F2 renames.
Assets (right)    Click an item to place it at the origin, inside the active Hierarchy group
                  (shown at the top of the panel).

Command line (testing)
----------------------
--stress N         Add N items to the sample level
--bench N          Run the built-in benchmark (N frames per phase), write bench.txt, exit
--bench-out PATH   Benchmark report location

Third-party software
